    "analyst_inference": "Associate this Next DC Corio site with the operator's GE1 code. The PDF does not print GE1 in extracted text; small render signage is not relied on as legible proof.",
    "strengthening_context": "The physical source explicitly lists GE1 Geelong. Operator identifies GE1 in Corio, and contractor Kapitol identifies the named GE1 Corio construction. The separate Lovely Banks landbank is a different locality and not selected.",
    "remaining_review": "Accept explicit analyst inference from the exact Next DC Corio government application and matching operator/builder GE1 Corio identity. Not a literal code-to-parcel statement."
  },
